	  ===== TODO: VIDEO CDN URL NEEDED =====
	  The hero video is gone. It used to stream from the old site's media
	  library, at a path that has since been retired, and video is never
	  committed to this repo either (.gitignore excludes *.mp4) — so there is
	  nothing local to point at. Until a CDN URL exists the poster frame stands
	  in: it is the video's own first frame, so the hero looks right, it just
	  doesn't move.

	  To restore it, replace the <img> below with:
	      <video class="hero__video" autoplay muted loop playsinline
	             preload="metadata" poster="/assets/video/home-poster.jpg">
	        <source src="{{ CDN }}/home.mp4" type="video/mp4">
	      </video>
	  where {{ CDN }} is the base URL. See README §9.3 — two more videos are
	  waiting on the same URL.
	#}
