		<div class="intro__text">
			<h2 class="intro__title reveal reveal--up">Elevate Your Potential<br><span>Partner For Growth</span></h2>
			<div class="prose reveal reveal--fade">
				<p>These aren't just words, they're a declaration of our commitment to your success, to pushing boundaries, and to creating a future where everyone thrives. <strong>Elevate</strong> means transcending what you once thought possible. We'll help you break barriers, overcome obstacles, and redefine what's achievable. With every step, we're propelling you toward new heights.</p>
				<p>But it's not just about surpassing limits, it's about realizing your true <strong>potential</strong>. We believe in defying the status quo and unlocking the full scope of your capabilities. Together, we'll redefine greatness.</p>
				<p><strong>Partnership</strong> is at the core of everything we do. We're not just advisors or colleagues, we're allies on a shared journey of <strong>growth</strong>. Your success is our success, and together, we'll scale unparalleled heights. It's about building lasting connections, collaborating and driving each other forward.</p>
				<p><a class="button button--solid button--blue" href="/meet-the-team/">Meet the Team</a></p>
			</div>
		</div>
